  "latest_final": "The key is the pun on “courses.” The student was at a banquet at the University of Hong Kong and was choosing dishes from a menu—food courses—rather than academic classes. The chosen food courses were served during the banquet, eaten, and then cleared away by the staff. Thus “all of my courses were gone in one evening” means the student’s selected banquet dishes had been consumed and removed, not that university class registrations vanished. The academic setting and deadline wording are deliberate misdirection.",
